# Copy to .env and uncomment/customize what you need for local development.
# All EXPO_PUBLIC_* vars are baked into the client bundle at build time —
# never put secrets here; they are effectively public.

# --- API provider (services/api/providers/) ---
# "ridebt" (default) = legacy reverse-engineered RideBT endpoints.
# "bt4u" = official Blacksburg Transit web service.
# See API_DOCUMENTATION.md / API_DOCUMENTATION_LEGACY.md.
# EXPO_PUBLIC_API_PROVIDER=bt4u

# --- BT4U CORS proxy (web only; native calls BT4U directly) ---
# Required for the `bt4u` provider to work on web, since the official service
# does not send a browser-permissive CORS header. See cloudflare-worker/README.md
# for a free, self-hostable Cloudflare Worker proxy. Include the trailing slash.
# EXPO_PUBLIC_BT4U_PROXY=https://your-worker.example.workers.dev/

# --- Self-hosted telemetry (services/telemetry.ts) ---
# Leave unset to disable telemetry entirely (the default in local dev).
# EXPO_PUBLIC_TELEMETRY_ENDPOINT=https://your-site.example/telemetry/events

# --- Canonical site URL (app/+html.tsx meta tags) ---
# Defaults to the production site if unset.
# EXPO_PUBLIC_SITE_URL=https://your-site.example
